# Seeded with the Lamplight fixture. The ten save slots, a restore from one,
# and the autosave carrying a story across a restart.
wait-for Lamplight
tap Lamplight
wait-for light.
tap Restore
expect Restore game
expect No saved games yet.
clean
shot saves-restore-empty
tap-id 4294967295
expect Lamplight
tap Save
expect Save game
expect Keep this position in a slot.
expect Empty: tap to save here
clean
shot saves-slots
# Slots 7 to 10 are on the next page.
page next
expect Slot 10
page back
expect Slot 1
tap Slot 1
wait-for Saved in slot 1.
tap-id 4294967295
tap North
wait-for Gravel crunches
tap Restore
expect Restore game
expect Saved game: tap to restore
expect-missing Slot 2
clean
shot saves-restore-one
tap Slot 1
wait-for Restored.
wait-for pool of light.
clean
shot saves-restored
# Saving over a slot says so.
tap Save
expect Saved game: tap to overwrite
tap-id 4294967295
# Every turn is kept, so the story opens where it stopped after a restart.
tap North
wait-for Gravel crunches
restart
wait-for Lamplight
tap Lamplight
wait-for Restored.
wait-for Gravel crunches
expect Garden Path
clean
shot saves-resumed
